<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Radiant prices at $9.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Radiant prices at $9.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		Radiant Systems Inc</p>
<p>    Priced At				     $9.50</p>
<p>    Estimated Pricing Range		$9 - $11</p>
<p>    Number of Shares			2,900,000</p>
<p>    Lead Underwriter	   Alex, Brown &amp; Sons</p>
<p>NOTE: The company revised the price range for its planned initial public offering down to $9 to $11 from $10 to $12 in a regulatory filing.</p>
<p>The company also lowered the number of shares proposed for its initial public offering to 2.9 million shares from 2.95 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
